2. वि-ष्ठा (√ स्था; for 1. विष्ठा See p. 996, col. 2) Ā. -तिष्ठते (cf. Pāṇ. i, 3, 22; Ved. and ep. also P.),
to stand or go apart, be spread or diffused or scattered over or through (acc. or अधि with loc.), RV.; VS.; AV.;
to be removed or separated from (instr.), TS.; AV.;
to stand, be stationary stand still, remain firm, abide, dwell, stop, RV. &c. &c.;
to keep ground, not to budge, R.;
to be present or near, MBh.;
to be engaged in (loc.), Hariv. :
Caus. (only aor. -तिष्ठिपः) to spread, expand, RV. i, 56, 5.
